      "source": "Configures the builder to embed the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/server/core/EmbeddedWrapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas.server.core\"><code>EmbeddedWrapper</code></a> instances. Creates a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/CollectionModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>CollectionModel</code></a>\ninstance to make sure the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/server/core/EmbeddedWrapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas.server.core\"><code>EmbeddedWrapper</code></a> handling gets applied to the serialization output ignoring the\nlinks.",
      "translation": "配置构建器以嵌入给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/server/core/EmbeddedWrapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas.server.core\"><code>EmbeddedWrapper</code></a> 实例。创建一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/CollectionModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>CollectionModel</code></a> 实例，以确保对 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/server/core/EmbeddedWrapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas.server.core\"><code>EmbeddedWrapper</code></a> 的处理被应用于序列化输出，同时忽略链接。",
      "count": 1
    },
